@startuml
title DEV-00 TARGET - DEV -> UAT -> human approval -> PROD (no deployment applied)
package "UAT - FIRST ONLINE TARGET / NOT PROVISIONED" {
  node "Browser" as browser {
    artifact "Web SPA" as spa
  }
  cloud "Cloudflare edge / DNS / TLS" as cf
  node "Cloudflare Pages UAT" as pages {
    artifact "apps/web/dist" as assets
  }
  node "Railway API UAT" as rail {
    artifact "Fastify Node API" as api
  }
  node "Railway PostgreSQL UAT" as storage {
    database PostgreSQL as db
  }
}
package "DEV local / Delivery" {
  rectangle "Local Web + API + PostgreSQL" as local
  rectangle "GitHub StockApp\nPR / required checks / review / normal merge" as github
  rectangle "GitHub Actions\nCI ONLY" as ci
  rectangle "Validated exact main SHA\nCI + GitGuardian + review" as validated
}
package "PROD FUTURE - NEW / INDEPENDENT / NOT PROVISIONED" {
  node "New Pages deployment + Railway API + PostgreSQL" as prod
  rectangle "UAT acceptance / release candidate\nExplicit human sign-off" as approval
}
package "Mobile EXISTING local / Sync DEFERRED" {
  node "Mobile device" as device {
    artifact "Expo Mobile" as mobile
    database "SQLite local" as sqlite
  }
}
browser --> cf : HTTPS static
cf --> pages : Entrega SPA
spa --> api : HTTPS API host
mobile --> sqlite : Local tx
mobile ..> api : FUTURE sync / outside Web-only release
api --> db : Private connection
github --> ci : Quality / build / tests
github --> validated : Exact SHA gate / no unchecked latest
validated ..> pages : FUTURE UAT CD / proven gate or controlled manual
validated ..> rail : FUTURE UAT CD / locked predeploy / fail-closed readiness
ci ..> github : Required result (no deploy)
pages ..> approval : UAT validation / smoke / rollback / recovery
rail ..> approval
approval ..> prod : Same approved commit/release / controlled deploy
note bottom of storage
  Synthetic test data only initially. UAT/PROD DB and secrets isolated.
  Provider "production" label may mean StockApp UAT, not commercial launch.
  No automatic main -> product PROD. DNS mapping approval pending DEV-04.
end note
note bottom of prod : No UAT DB copy. PROD migrations reviewed separately; smoke and monitoring required.
@enduml
